  ],
  "lyrics":[
    {
      "section_id":"section_0",
      "type":"intro",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"In Nashville, the president tried to keep up the pressure",
          "rhyme":"yR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"There's an old saying in Tennessee, I know it's in Texas, probably in Tennessee, that says, \"Fool me once, shame on... shame on you",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"You fool me— can't get fooled again\"",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABC"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"What's the matter, all your guns have a cold?",
          "rhyme":"old",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"'Cause y'all be lettin' bullets run out like you blowin' your nose",
          "rhyme":"oz",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"You just a Joe in some clothes, allowin' homes to explode",
          "rhyme":"Od",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Family of four hits the floor with their bones on the road",
          "rhyme":"ad",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"I ain't hatin' on your duty, y'all some soldiers of war",
          "rhyme":"aR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Kids dyin' in the street, don't even know there's a war",
          "rhyme":"aR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"You've heard it before, victims hidden by the president",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Invadin' countries for some weapons, missin' all the evidence",
          "rhyme":"#s",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Imprison the prisoners, listen to parishioners",
          "rhyme":"9R",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Look at yourself, takin' orders from your minister",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Mind-locked, you's a P.O.W",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Ain't a real man if every death doesn't trouble you",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"George W., you just not learnin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Brainwashed by the sermon, thought you heard certain",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"One in a dozen, my cousin didn't have a choice",
          "rhyme":"as",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Wanted to go home, but they didn't let him have a voice",
          "rhyme":"as",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"Say it was right, wanted to make him a wife",
          "rhyme":"ajf",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"But the evil, lethal people already takin' his life",
          "rhyme":"ajf",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"So if ya takin' a stand, make sure that you can",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"And don't ever speak if you're not raisin' your hand",
          "rhyme":"#d",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"The life he made for his son, savin' his funds",
          "rhyme":"wndz",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"Dreamin' 'bout the doctor, lawyer that one day he'd become",
          "rhyme":"om",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"But too busy playin' with guns, they say it was dumb",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"How you supposed to hide when you got nowhere to run?",
          "rhyme":"(",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"24",
          "text":"It's a shame 'cause Nick would've been a great father",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"25",
          "text":"Why bother the same slaughter to praise Allah?",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"26",
          "text":"I oughta celebrate my cousin's memory",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"27",
          "text":"But who deserves a penalty in a fight without an enemy?",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDEEFGHIIJKKLLMMFNOPQRSTUU",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AABCCCDDEFFGHHCCCCDDIAJKLCMM"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_2",
      "type":"chorus",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"We brothers in arms, we can't give a hand",
          "rhyme":"#d",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"I can't sit back, let it happen, livin' to stand",
          "rhyme":"#d",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Takin' it on as my personal mission",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Try and yell for help, but ain't nobody listen",
          "rhyme":"En",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AABC",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AABC"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_3",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Kids dream about just bein' some thugs",
          "rhyme":"yg",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"But they just shrug when you ask 'em if they busted a slug",
          "rhyme":"9g",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"And now you dropped out of school 'cause you thought it was cool",
          "rhyme":"ul",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Forgot that your crew never even shot at a dude",
          "rhyme":"yd",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"When you cocked up the Uzi, now you locked up in juvie",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Tryna imitate the gangster that you saw in the movies",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Your act didn't fool me, you're still just a goonie",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Tryna pull that, if I don't move, you're gonna shoot me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Go ahead, do me in if that's how it has to happen",
          "rhyme":"@n",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"'Cause I'ma keep rappin' when the people stop clappin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Stop askin' 'cause I'm hatin', not lovin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"You're nothin' if you're willin' to shoot down your own brethren",
          "rhyme":"En",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"I ain't tryna act like a modern prophet",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"I don't even give charity money out my pocket",
          "rhyme":"Et",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"The Glock? Nah, never cocked it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"So drop it, haters need to stop it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"Words seek your brain like a heat-seekin' rocket",
          "rhyme":"Et",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"I talk the talk as well as walk it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"I speak from the heart, haters just mock it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"Tryna reunite people like Pac did",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"God, is there a chance that you're there?",
          "rhyme":"eR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"If you're listenin', will you please answer my prayers?",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"I know it's been a while since our last conversation",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"I think Satan's been givin' me temptation",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"24",
          "text":"It's your vocation to give me salvation",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"25",
          "text":"So please, can you help me with my current situation?",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"26",
          "text":"Since creation, my orientation",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"27",
          "text":"I've had the information, given inspiration",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"28",
          "text":"When can I expect the next resurrection?",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"29",
          "text":"I'm lookin' in the mirror, not seein' a reflection",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"30",
          "text":"So if you see Easy Mac, bless him",
          "rhyme":"im",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"31",
          "text":"'Cause he's in need of protection",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDEEEFGHHIJKLLKLLMNOPPPPPPPPQP",
